          automatics: [ { name: "8-Speed Automatic (ZF 8HP45)", torqueLimit: "450 Nm", oilType: "ZF Lifeguard 8", note: "The incredibly refined ZF 8-speed (standard on later LCI models). It delivers flawless shifts and perfectly masks the engine's narrow torque band. Fluid flush every 80k km is vital." } ]
